
flowchart TD
    A[Input: Four Iris Features] --> B[StandardScaler]
    B --> C[Scaled Feature Vector]
    C --> D[One-vs-Rest Classifier]

    D --> E[Classifier 1: Setosa vs Rest]
    D --> F[Classifier 2: Versicolor vs Rest]
    D --> G[Classifier 3: Virginica vs Rest]

    E --> H[Probability: Setosa]
    F --> I[Probability: Versicolor]
    G --> J[Probability: Virginica]

    H --> K[Compare Class Scores]
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K --> L[Select Highest Score]
    L --> M[Predicted Iris Species]
